WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.595
One tree: 木.
一棵树：木。

00:02.595 --> 00:05.190
Two trees: woods.
两棵树：林。

00:05.190 --> 00:07.785
Three trees: forest.
三棵树：森。

00:07.785 --> 00:10.380
That's real. That's actually how it works.
这是真的。它确实就是这样运作的。

00:10.380 --> 00:12.975
English needs three unrelated words — tree, woods, forest.
英语需要三个互不相干的词——tree、woods、forest。

00:12.975 --> 00:15.570
Chinese just plants more trees.
中文只是多种几棵树。

00:15.570 --> 00:18.165
And it doesn't stop: one person, 人.
而且不止如此：一个人，人。

00:18.165 --> 00:20.760
Two people: to follow.
两个人：从，跟随。

00:20.760 --> 00:23.355
Three people: a crowd.
三个人：众，人群。

00:23.355 --> 00:25.950
There's even a proverb — one tree does not make a forest.
甚至还有一句谚语——独木不成林。

00:25.950 --> 00:28.545
English says no man is an island.
英语说，没有人是一座孤岛。

00:28.545 --> 00:31.138
Chinese says: no tree is a forest.
中文说：一棵树成不了森林。
